 150s cooldown.\n\nAurora's freeze effects can also affect Turrets.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c6d80942b639b97fbeffc5fd9ee8167e.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Death Immunity","rgb":"177,157,96"}]},{"id":3610,"name":"Hailstone Blast","description":"Aurora summons an icy meteorite to strike at the target location, dealing 400 (+90% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slowing targets hit by 40% for 1s. Afterward, 5 hailstones fall, each dealing 40 (+10% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_209d6465a2c64f50265810fcbaa0c8bb.png","video":null,"cd":5.0,"cost":60.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":3620,"name":"Frosty Breeze","description":"Aurora blows Frosty Breeze in a fan-shaped area in the target direction, dealing 225 (+75% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit and creating a frozen area at the far end.\n\nThe area deals a total of 225 (+75% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies within and freezes them for 1s (increases by 0.06s for every 100 ).","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ef80a610e18430d6ff01ee049d08a489.png","video":null,"cd":10.0,"cost":75.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":3630,"name":"Frigid Glacier","description":"Aurora creates a frost path in the target direction, dealing 100 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in the path and slowing them by 80% for 1.2s.\n\nThe frost path gradually expands into a glacier that shatters at maximum size, dealing 600 (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to all enemies in the area and freezing them for 1s (increases by 0.2s for every 100 ).","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_42818d794bbe6206d10e9658013ab033.png","video":null,"cd":50.0,"cost":140.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"With her very powerful CC abilities, Aurora works well with heroes who deal high sustained damage, like Ixia, Freya, and Karrie.","heroes":[{"id":121,"name":"Ixia","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f070d82521ecd2e14d4ef3f25880830a.png"},{"id":22,"name":"Freya","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b9c34c88762ca8e66ccd4d84071bf0bc.png"},{"id":40,"name":"Karrie","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_294576f2bd0dcbcc9041031969d0eb09.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Aurora counters heroes who like to charge in, such as Leomord, Thamuz, and Terizla, since her skills can stop them dead in their tracks.","heroes":[{"id":67,"name":"Leomord","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_554cdf13a7587fe08c5deed60132c61c.png"},{"id":72,"name":"Thamuz","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b5ad55e408b68acf6a86e7ff76f5f569.png"},{"id":82,"name":"Terizla","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c4bb270c28c7be663f57e993b0d6d3d8.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Because most of Aurora's skills have delayed effects, she is countered by high mobility heroes who can dodge them with ease, such as Ling, Kadita, and Guinevere.","heroes":[{"id":84,"name":"Ling","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_017bade52b9fc94bbc12615de6d75c08.png"},{"id":75,"name":"Kadita","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_99c0a77d0e01b06ad3f4351f8ef2869c.png"},{"id":80,"name":"Guinevere","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test